          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's Included",
            "content": "<p>Wrinkle Erase Kit<\/p><ul><li>4oz Mangosteen Cleanser <\/li><li>1oz Anti Aging Peptide Serum<\/li><li>2 EGF Restorative Sheet Masks<\/li><li>1 Vitalizing Sheet Mask<\/li><li>4oz ATP Booster Gel<\/li><li>.5oz Eye Lift Serum<\/li><li>2oz Infused Conductive Solution<\/li><li>1 pair Conductive Gloves<\/li><li>1 set Splitter Wires<\/li><li>1 Eye Mask<\/li><li>1 Lip Mask<\/li><li>Brush <\/li><li>Headband<\/li><li>MyoLift Bag <\/li><\/ul><p>Moisture Boost Kit<\/p><ul><li>4oz Mangosteen Cleanser<\/li><li>EGF Restorative Sheet (2 Masks)<\/li><li>1 Vitalizing Sheet Mask<\/li><li>4oz ReNu<\/li><li>2oz RePlenish Spritzer<\/li><li>7e Brush and Headband<\/li><li>MyoLift Bag <\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
